    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Car Rental is a responsive website theme created for transportation and vehicle reservation platforms. The layout includes dedicated sections for vehicle categories, booking forms, pricing tables, contact information, and customer support details. It features a structured design that helps organize service information clearly across desktop and mobile devices. The theme includes customization options for colors, fonts, headers, menus, and page layouts without requiring advanced technical adjustments. It also supports image galleries, service listings, testimonial sections, and blog pages for sharing updates or informational content. Built-in navigation elements and organized content blocks help improve accessibility and user experience. Flex Car Rental is designed with lightweight coding practices to support stable performance and consistent page loading speeds. The theme can be used for presenting services related to car booking agencies, taxi services, chauffeur services, or limousine services. Additional features such as social media integration, banner sections, and inquiry forms help create a functional and informative transportation-focused website layout."
    },
